Package: proxbackup-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Matteo Lo Piccolo <lopicl.00@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: proxmox-backup-server (>= 3.0), systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ProxBackup Console - manage Windows PC backups to this PBS
 Management server for ProxBackup agents, installed directly on a Proxmox
 Backup Server. It registers the local datastores, provisions per-PC
 namespaces and API tokens, pushes backup schedules to the agents, applies
 retention and shows run history, logs and restores.
 .
 Web UI and agent API on port 8077. PBS administrators (e.g. root@pam) can
 sign in with their PBS credentials.
